OL,3,GNEWSAChancellor urges Welsh government
OL,4,Ato give people #100 for energy bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chancellor has urged the Welsh
OL,7,Fgovernment to implement a #100
OL,8,F"household energy payment" to council
OL,9,Ftaxpayers.
OL,11,FJohn Healey said 20 million homes in
OL,12,Fcouncil tax bands A-D in England would
OL,13,Fget the payment as he called on Welsh
OL,14,Fministers to do the same for Wales.
OL,16,FHe also announced #30m to fund a new
OL,17,Ftrain station in the east of Cardiff.
OL,19,FThe UK government said the Welsh
OL,20,Fgovernment, which funds public services
OL,21,Fin Wales including the NHS, would get
OL,22,Fan extra #450m over three years.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
